      "displayName": "Tripo 3D",
      "displayName_i18n": {
        "en": "Tripo 3D",
        "zh-CN": "Tripo 3D"
      },
      "description": "Generate textured, rig-ready 3D models from a text prompt or a reference image with Tripo, and export GLB/FBX/OBJ/STL/USDZ/3MF straight into your project. Connect your China-mainland Tripo account once in the browser (OAuth), no API key pasting.",
      "description_i18n": {
        "en": "Generate textured, rig-ready 3D models from a text prompt or a reference image with Tripo, and export GLB/FBX/OBJ/STL/USDZ/3MF straight into your project. Connect your China-mainland Tripo account once in the browser (OAuth), no API key pasting.",
        "zh-CN": "用 Tripo 从一句话或一张图生成带贴图、可绑骨的 3D 模型，支持动画、减面与 GLB/FBX/OBJ/STL/USDZ/3MF 导出，文件直接落到项目里。浏览器里授权一次国内站 Tripo 账号即可使用，无需粘贴 API Key。"
      },
      "version": "0.1.3",
      "author": {
        "name": "VAST",
        "url": "https://www.tripo3d.ai"
      },
      "icon": "https://cdn-zcode.z.ai/zcode/official-plugin/assets/tripo-3d/icon.png",
      "category": "productivity",
      "keywords": [
        "3d",
        "asset-generation",
        "game-development",
        "glb",
        "fbx",
        "text-to-3d",
        "image-to-3d",
        "3d-printing",
        "rigging",
        "mcp"
      ],
      "examplePrompts": [
        "Generate a low-poly treasure chest and export it as FBX for Unity",
        "Turn this concept image into a textured 3D model and export it as GLB",
        "Make a 3D-printable knight figurine and export STL"
      ],
      "examplePrompts_i18n": {
